	"name": "Braced for Impact",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/melee/shield-block-bash-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 10th level you’ve long since learned that sometimes you can’t avoid the hits that are coming, and you just have to grit your teeth and face the pain. As a bonus action, you may brace for impact and gain temporary hit points equal to your Proficiency bonus that refresh at the start of each round for 3 rounds. You can use this ability once per short or long rest. At 15th level, you can use this bonus action twice per short or long rest.</p>",
